      "type": "spotlight",
      "item": "tribalpower:item_relay",
      "text": [
        "Move items or fluid between two machines without a line of pipes. Snap a relay plate onto a face of each, pair them, and every second the cargo jumps across.",
        "Relays are for distance. For machines that touch, set their faces instead."
      ],
      "title": "Wireless cargo"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Snapping and pairing",
      "text": [
        "Place a plate against a face of a machine or chest. It works the block it is stuck to.",
        "Right-click a plate to open it. Put the **same item** in the **Bond** slot of both plates and they pair; a renamed or otherwise marked item makes a private pair. Hoppers can never steal the Bond or Rune.",
        "Crouch and right-click a plate to switch it between **extract** and **insert**. Set the sending plate to extract and the receiving one to insert.",
        "Keep Pulse within 8 blocks of the **sending** plate."
      ]
    },
